    "image_with_text_7CFgKR": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_pT4Q9U": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Medical Industry Tapes"
          }
        },
        "heading_Mnm7bM": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Key Medical Applications for</strong> <strong>Adhesive Tapes?</strong>",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h3"
          }
        },
        "text_fc9TGQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Medical adhesive tapes offer a practical and cost-effective way to simplify medical procedures. Various types of adhesive tapes are used to seal wounds, attach dressings, attach wearable technologies, or protect against infections. Adhesive tapes within the medical industry must be gentle on the skin while having the necessary strength and durability required for medical applications.</p><p>The medical sector uses adhesive tapes in many applications, including the following:</p><ul><li>Sealing medical device LCD screens</li><li>Sealing ostomy equipment</li><li>Medical device cushioning</li><li>Prosthetic padding</li><li>Wound dressing</li><li>Electrode device attachment</li><li>Sealing control panels and keyboards</li><li>Device mounting</li><li>Surgical patches</li></ul>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
